{{/*
	The "dance" view. Each {{define}} is a block; commands.lua says
	which block each player sees, so the dancer and the onlookers read
	different lines. {{entity .actor}} writes a name, which is clickable in
	the web client. Add a dance.html.tmpl beside this file to give the web
	its own version.
*/}}
{{define "actor"}}You dance a little jig.{{end}}
{{define "others"}}{{entity .actor}} dances a little jig.{{end}}
